		{"id":"ea8b0654c4335970","type":"text","text":"Koko schickt Samsa zu den Menschen von NeuBerlin.\n\nEmpfänger: Gojan","x":712,"y":60,"width":250,"height":134},
		{"id":"0450eb3cafc30299","type":"text","text":"# Die Menschheit bricht auf","x":3080,"y":-169,"width":393,"height":118},
		{"id":"1aa9f27ccb826acf","type":"text","text":"Aufbruchstimmung. Der Himmel ist ein neuer Kontinent!\n\nBeginn einer Ära: Die Himmelstürmer","x":3080,"y":60,"width":250,"height":180},
		{"id":"fecc90208b858715","type":"text","text":"Wir tauchen in Koko's Unterbewusstsein hinab.\n\nHinweis, dass Koko längst weiß, wo Wolke 7000 ist","x":3720,"y":60,"width":250,"height":203},
		{"id":"ea4e073773241881","type":"text","text":"# U-Boote\n ","x":3720,"y":-129,"width":250,"height":39},
